OL,3,GNEWSACity to get live facial
OL,4,Arecognition for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice will deploy live facial
OL,7,Frecognition (LFR) in Cambridge for the
OL,8,Ffirst time.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said LFR will be
OL,11,Fused in the city on Friday, following
OL,12,Fdeployments in Peterborough earlier
OL,13,Fthis year, which the force said had
OL,14,Fproved successful.
OL,16,FThe system scans faces from a live
OL,17,Fcamera feed and compares them in real
OL,18,Ftime with a watchlist of high-risk
OL,19,Findividuals, including those wanted for
OL,20,Fcriminal offences, with an outstanding
OL,21,Fwarrant or subject to court-imposed
OL,22,Frequirements.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
