OL,3,GNEWSACity to get live facial
OL,4,Arecognition for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Luke Charlton said: "Live facial
OL,7,Frecognition is another valuable tool
OL,8,Fthat helps us protect the public by
OL,9,Fidentifying wanted offenders and those
OL,10,Fwho may pose a risk to our
OL,11,Fcommunities."
